69 "Google Earth Link is a MapBasic"
70 "application that automates the export"
71 "of vector and raster maps created in"
72 "MapInfo Professional 8.0 (or later)"
73 "to the Google Earth application."
74 "You can use this tool to enhance the"
75 "look of your MapInfo Professional maps"
76 "and data and make your data more"
77 "location intelligent."
78 "To learn more about using the Google Earth"
79 "Link tool, see the GoogleEarthLink.chm"
80 "or GoogleEarthLink.pdf on the"
81 "installation web page."
82 "Google and Google Earth  are trademarks"
83 "of Google, Inc.  All rights are reserved."
